{{!
    @template local_edguidance/block

    One teacher guidance block, wherever it is shown: an activity card, a book chapter, a lesson page
    or a section summary.

    Only ever rendered for a block the current user has not dismissed; a dismissed block renders
    nothing at all. Both states are here all the same - the guidance, and the confirmation shown once
    it is dismissed, with an undo - so local_edguidance/guidance only toggles between them and undo
    needs no round trip for markup.

    This must never contain the data-edguidance attribute. That is the token filter_edguidance looks
    for, and mod_lesson runs some text through the filters twice.

    The category is named in the header as well as coloured, so that it does not rest on colour alone.
    A task, optional or not, is marked as complete rather than as read.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * id int - local_edguidance.id
    * category string - note, recommendation, task or optionaltask
    * categoryname string - the category's name, for people
    * task bool - marked as complete rather than as read
    * heading string - already formatted by format_string(), rendered unescaped; '' for none
    * body string - already formatted HTML, rendered unescaped
    * missing bool - the preset it used has gone, so the body is a possibly stale copy
    * preview bool - for the editor's preview: no buttons, because a click anywhere on it edits it

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": 42,
        "category": "task",
        "categoryname": "Task",
        "task": true,
        "heading": "Before the course opens",
        "body": "<p>Set the due date before releasing this to students.</p>",
        "missing": false,
        "preview": false
    }
}}
<div class="edguidance edguidance-{{category}}" data-region="edguidance" data-guidanceid="{{id}}">
    <div class="edguidance-card">
        <div class="edguidance-header">
            <span class="edguidance-title">{{categoryname}}</span>
            <span class="edguidance-scope">{{#str}} onlyteachers, local_edguidance {{/str}}</span>
            {{^preview}}
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-link btn-sm edguidance-dismiss" data-action="edguidance-dismiss"
                data-region="edguidance-live">{{#pix}} t/markasread, core {{/pix}}{{#task}}{{#str}} markascomplete, local_edguidance {{/str}}{{/task}}{{^task}}{{#str}} markasread, local_edguidance {{/str}}{{/task}}</button>
            {{/preview}}
        </div>
        <div data-region="edguidance-live">
            {{#heading}}
                <h5 class="edguidance-heading">{{{heading}}}</h5>
            {{/heading}}
            {{#missing}}
                <div class="alert alert-info edguidance-missing" role="alert">{{#str}} guidancemissing, local_edguidance {{/str}}</div>
            {{/missing}}
            <div class="edguidance-body">{{{body}}}</div>
        </div>
        {{^preview}}
        <div class="edguidance-confirm" data-region="edguidance-dismissed" hidden>
            {{#task}}{{#str}} completedconfirm, local_edguidance {{/str}}{{/task}}
            {{^task}}{{#str}} dismissedconfirm, local_edguidance {{/str}}{{/task}}
            {{#str}} dismissedundo, local_edguidance {{/str}}
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-link p-0 align-baseline edguidance-undo" data-action="edguidance-undo">
                {{#str}} undo, local_edguidance {{/str}}
            </button>
        </div>
        {{/preview}}
    </div>
</div>
